!reports/README.md

# Training artifacts: anomalib / lightning checkpoints, scratch run trees.
# These are reproducible from the documented training commands and exceed
# GitHub's 100 MB file size limit.
reports/**/*.ckpt

# Machine-generated agent run artifacts and scratch probe trees. These are
# process output, not evidence, and must never enter this public repo.
# Curated, human-reviewed evidence lives in reports/verification/ instead.
reports/agent_*/
reports/**/agent_*/
reports/tmp_*/
reports/**/tmp_*/
*_agent_report*.json

# Agent plan / task / session markdown belongs in the private vault, not here.
AGENTS.md
**/AGENTS.md
plans/
sessions/
*_plan.md
*_fixlist.md
*_punchlist.md

